  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extension of rehabilitation diagnostic services (Development Phase)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is defined as the improvement of diagnostic and surgical services at municipal regional hospitals and tertiary (referral and specialized) hospitals through provision of medical equipment and infrastructure preventive and corrective maintenance training and technical assistance. The project focuses specifically on mother and neonatal care, improvement of emergency services, operating theatres intensive care units high dependence wards patient monitoring and rehabilitation services. The project contributes to:- strengthening the Referral System, making it more efficient and effective at all levels- reducing the lack of specialized services in diagnostics operating theatres and maternity care.</narrative>
  </description>
